{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":239536,\"title\":\"The Golden Key\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A film combining live action and stop-motion animation about the adventures of the wooden boy Pinocchio and his friends - Pierrot, Malvina and Artemon the Poodle, about the mysterious golden key that opens the cherished door, about the good Papa Carlo and the evil Karabas-Barabas, Duremar, Basilio the Cat and Alice the Fox.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iaHKyRQBM8jStZCtR7B4TrQFFyI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uPtbbo5Zvim6MJYQAXr4qPVd9E0.jpg\",\"rating\":5.4,\"voteCount\":16,\"year\":1939,\"runtime\":72,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Fantasy\",\"Adventure\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"SU\",\"name\":\"Soviet Union\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Aleksandr Ptushko\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":225723,\"name\":\"Aleksandr Ptushko\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wtH0n1wiBvQliSSgsLOyRBCzgMS.jpg\"},{\"id\":86841,\"name\":\"Sergei Martinson\",\"character\":\"Duremar\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/57AStVQT0MTdgKHeHVeWliUpbfa.jpg\"},{\"id\":1292428,\"name\":\"Olga Shaganova-Obraztsova\",\"character\":\"Buratino\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tHdICzPDGrDP8DA5HzgdUT6kYqr.jpg\"},{\"id\":2338625,\"name\":\"Aleksandr Shchagin\",\"character\":\"Karabas-Barabas\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6vYINoMb7O9PFPvETKGNlXOjkQg.jpg\"},{\"id\":2338630,\"name\":\"Georgiy Uvarov\",\"character\":\"Papa Carlo\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pkjvmNEvBN98EhcxaZS7PYl1jZB.jpg\"},{\"id\":1290497,\"name\":\"Mikhail Dagmarov\",\"character\":\"Giuseppe\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tb4B6j2m8E8z1tzW9fGMQhleXT4.jpg\"},{\"id\":1292429,\"name\":\"Raisa Khairova\",\"character\":\"Pierrot\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1372099,\"name\":\"Tamara Adelheim\",\"character\":\"Malvina\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/t7l8sN8CKgK9JFbqrZJH7ytZJHJ.jpg\"},{\"id\":1461090,\"name\":\"Nikolai Michurin\",\"character\":\"Sandro\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xU3atChva8OmDYQtfZMr76MwQA3.jpg\"},{\"id\":2338652,\"name\":\"Valentina Pokorskaya\",\"character\":\"Alice\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2338660,\"name\":\"Kirill Nikiforov\",\"character\":\"Basilio\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":557269,\"name\":\"Nikolai Bogolyubov\",\"character\":\"Air ship captain\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A2Er4ZVona4gLDn56WG790SiZle.jpg\"},{\"id\":1461082,\"name\":\"S. Zonnenburg\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1461084,\"name\":\"Aleksandra Vasilyeva\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xEF7ZqrMwDrjIDgUphtpmILvcv4.jpg\"},{\"id\":3540439,\"name\":\"Veniamin Gut\",\"character\":\"(uncredited)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2405927,\"name\":\"Vasiliy Krasnoshchyokov\",\"character\":\"Policeman (uncredited)\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":791523,\"title\":\"Wildwood\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/snFM00mpNAfUzUtkdEW0uDEvXA0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sl5NJ1vtyhP9Vr88bB4blULsJYp.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Prue and her classmate Curtis are drawn into a magical forest filled with enchanted creatures, loyal allies, and formidable adversaries as they embark on a desperate quest to rescue Prue's abducted baby brother from a murder of crows led by a mysterious woman named Alexandra.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1465063,\"title\":\"Forgotten Island\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/myd1K3gefdNAWFsGNRDdMeiK9Qg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2o9FzuBzCqrDTdlHRuEVnGD2d5h.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"While celebrating their last night together, high school graduates and best friends Jo and Raissa stumble upon a mysterious portal that transports them to the fantastical island of Nakali. When they discover that the memories of their entire friendship are the price for returning home, Jo and Raissa must race to find a way to leave the island before they forget each other forever.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1315772,\"title\":\"Minions & Monsters\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4LwvU9SZc8QQzW1X1FAPhNbXnEU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kkcwhgSFd81QDlXo8ytrpHPQjhy.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This is the rambunctious, ridiculous and totally true story of how the Minions conquered Hollywood, became movie stars, lost everything, unleashed monsters onto the world and then banded together to try and save the planet from the mayhem they had just created.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":980431,\"title\":\"Avatar Aang: The Last Airbender\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3sgnSfNT27Bx5O5ukr7B26mhEQq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ezbrL1dMymKQZw7mDEWa2ZTzN7d.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Avatar Aang, the world's last Airbender, learns of an ancient power that could save his culture from extinction. With the help of his friends, he embarks on a global quest to find it before it falls into the wrong hands and threatens to upend the peace they sacrificed everything to achieve.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1226863,\"title\":\"The Super Mario Galaxy Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eJGWx219ZcEMVQJhAgMiqo8tYY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kxQiIJ4gVcD3K6o14MJ72p5yRcE.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Having thwarted Bowser's previous plot to marry Princess Peach, Mario and Luigi now face a fresh threat in Bowser Jr., who is determined to liberate his father from captivity and restore the family legacy. Alongside companions new and old, the brothers travel across the stars to stop the young heir's crusade.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1007757,\"title\":\"Swapped\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tHhxWxge06goXU6ZQH1hj7vK8Hd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zMwhWailP1WY7sb6AoE6b8ugoy.jpg\",\"rating\":8.8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A small woodland creature and a majestic bird, two natural sworn enemies of the Valley, magically trade places and set off on an adventure of a lifetime to switch back. Their journey soon uncovers a greater threat—one that could endanger not only their species, but the entire valley they call home.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1185806,\"title\":\"PAW Patrol: The Dino Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cxXSF4aY5N2cOGwaga5OnpPFHzk.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dY4LyVSvjk9dN20YsxuouaMIMox.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Paw Patrol lands on a mysterious dinosaur island after a storm, where they meet Rex, a stranded pup. When Humdinger's reckless mining triggers a volcano, the team faces their biggest rescue mission yet to save the island.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":808,\"title\":\"Shrek\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zscUsmzDJFZjUY8f8BQqMSWlmNQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2Biv1mSzaaxWOqvcnDZn4GcYEAb.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"It ain't easy bein' green -- especially if you're a likable (albeit smelly) ogre named Shrek. On a mission to retrieve a gorgeous princess from the clutches of a fire-breathing dragon, Shrek teams up with an unlikely compatriot -- a wisecracking donkey.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":109445,\"title\":\"Frozen\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/itAKcobTYGpYT8Phwjd8c9hleTo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rj58WQ9ImI0mYDptXdM7euX1Wjt.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Young princess Anna of Arendelle dreams about finding true love at her sister Elsa’s coronation. Fate takes her on a dangerous journey in an attempt to end the eternal winter that has fallen over the kingdom. She's accompanied by ice delivery man Kristoff, his reindeer Sven, and snowman Olaf. On an adventure where she will find out what friendship, courage, family, and true love really means.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":980477,\"title\":\"Ne Zha 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fcs5AdCKliQaQgXsPS9kDejamIJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gd9kxeEEONj5SECs4GA8Ddn3czI.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a catastrophic event leaves their bodies destroyed, Ne Zha and Ao Bing are granted a fragile second chance at life. As tensions rise between the dragon clans and celestial forces, the two must undergo a series of perilous trials that will test their bond, challenge their identities, and decide the fate of both mortals and immortals.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":315162,\"title\":\"Puss in Boots: The Last Wish\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kuf6dutpsT0vSVehic3EZIqkOBt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jr8tSoJGj33XLgFBy6lmZhpGQNu.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Puss in Boots discovers that his passion for adventure has taken its toll: He has burned through eight of his nine lives, leaving him with only one life left. Puss sets out on an epic journey to find the mythical Last Wish and restore his nine lives.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"NqSxXJJcIOI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"CCJY7UKP74U\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"9GEOqe8bEf4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}